WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:07.940
Mice without TRPV1 keep much of their response to painful heat.

2
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:09.980
So what else senses the burn?

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.820
In 2011, TRPM3 was found to contribute heat sensitivity to some small mouse sensory

4
00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:18.820
neurons.

5
00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:22.253
Mice lacking it avoided noxious heat less well.

6
00:00:23.173 --> 00:00:25.133
TRPA1 was a third candidate.

7
00:00:26.133 --> 00:00:30.313
Suppose the three worked in series, each passing the signal to the next.

8
00:00:31.113 --> 00:00:32.593
What would each single knockout do?

9
00:00:38.533 --> 00:00:41.913
In series, every single knockout would abolish the withdrawal.

10
00:00:42.953 --> 00:00:43.953
They do not.

11
00:00:44.567 --> 00:00:46.327
Now suppose they work in parallel.

12
00:00:47.267 --> 00:00:48.767
What would it take to remove the reflex?

13
00:00:54.867 --> 00:00:56.167
All three at once.

14
00:00:56.967 --> 00:01:02.107
In 2018, mice lacking all three lacked acute withdrawal from noxious heat, in the

15
00:01:02.107 --> 00:01:03.107
reported assays.

16
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.320
The channels are redundant for this reflex.

17
00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:12.440
Remove one, and the others carry the signal.

18
00:01:13.450 --> 00:01:16.810
Remove all three, and the acute reflex has nothing left.

19
00:01:17.783 --> 00:01:20.323
But the same mice still preferred moderate temperatures.

20
00:01:21.416 --> 00:01:23.876
Withdrawal and preference are different behaviours.

21
00:01:24.956 --> 00:01:28.496
Whatever supports preference is not exhausted by these three channels.

22
00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:31.280
Set this beside the cool line.

23
00:01:32.140 --> 00:01:35.700
The cool fibres' resting firing depends on TRPM8.

24
00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:39.090
So losing TRPM8 cost warmth.

25
00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:42.310
Here, three channels can each carry the heat signal.

26
00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:47.400
So losing TRPV1 alone did not abolish the burn.

27
00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:52.900
In mice, acute heat withdrawal survives the loss of any one of three channels.
